+# section 8): THE BATCHNORM EPILOGUES FUSED (MOJOLEARN_IDN_CNN_BN_FUSE, the
+# ResNet BasicBlock's chain). Each function below stores exactly the word the
+# unfused launches stored, computed through the same functions in the same
+# order; only the intermediate array (the BN output before its ReLU, the
+# masked gradient before the BN backward) is never written or read back.
+#   bn1 -> relu1:        relu_fwd_at(bn_apply_at(x))      = `bn_apply_relu_at`
+#   bn2 -> add -> relu2: relu(add_at(bn_apply_at(x), id)) = `bn_apply_add_val`
+#                        (the sum is stored: relu2's backward reads it) + `relu_val`
+#   relu1 bwd -> bn1 bwd: bn_bwd_*(relu_bwd_at(mask, g))  = the `_relu` forms
+# Host-safe (no device construct), so the host column could spell the same
